-- Bo du lieu test toan dien cho tinh nang "Tasker goi y" (module Matching/AI) - 60 tai
-- khoan Tasker + 15 tai khoan Task Poster, sinh tu dong bang script (khong go tay tung
-- dong, tranh sai sot o quy mo lon) de bao phu toi da cac to hop:
--   - 8 khu vuc: uu tien TP. Ho Chi Minh / Ha Noi / Hue (45 Tasker), con lai rai deu 5
--     tinh le (Soc Trang, Ha Giang, Cao Bang, Bac Lieu, Kon Tum). Poster them ca Lai
--     Chau - CHU DICH khong co Tasker seed nao gan, test man hinh "Chua tim duoc Tasker
--     phu hop" (MATCH-404-NO_TASKER_FOUND).
--   - Xac minh: verification_status ho so ky nang trai deu VERIFIED/PENDING/REJECTED/
--     CANCELLED (ca 4 gia tri enum SkillVerificationStatus); kyc_status doc lap trai deu
--     NOT_SUBMITTED/VERIFYING/VERIFIED/REJECTED/CANCELLED (ca 5 gia tri enum KycStatus).
--   - Kinh nghiem 0-10 nam, gia va ban kinh trai deu, lich ranh da dang (mot so Tasker
--     KHONG khai lich nao - test availabilityMatches() tra null).
--   - Bio doi theo tung category (3 bien the/category) + ~2/3 co them 1 trong 9 chu de
--     bo sung da dang (bao hanh, dung cu, gia ca, toc do, doi nhom, thanh toan, khu vuc
--     quen thuoc, thai do lam viec, danh gia khach quen), de test Groq viet
--     reasons/concerns khong lap khuon - KHONG con chu de thu cung.
-- Day KHONG phai "train" AI - Groq/Gemini la API model co san, seed nay chi phuc vu
-- retrieval + demo end-to-end. Mat khau demo dung chung: Tasker67@ (hash bcrypt cost 10
-- tinh bang chinh org.springframework.security.crypto.bcrypt.BCrypt qua jshell, da
-- checkpw() xac minh khop - xem PROGRESS-AI-MATCHING-MODULE.md). Email @seed.taskconnect.vn.

-- ===================== 60 TAI KHOAN TASKER =====================

SELECT UNHEX(REPLACE(UUID(), '-', '')), `id`, 'TASKER', NOW(3)
FROM `auth_accounts` WHERE `email` LIKE 'tasker%@seed.taskconnect.vn';

-- ===================== 15 TAI KHOAN TASK POSTER =====================

SELECT UNHEX(REPLACE(UUID(), '-', '')), `id`, 'TASK_POSTER', NOW(3)
FROM `auth_accounts` WHERE `email` LIKE 'poster%@seed.taskconnect.vn';

